# E03 LRTA Search: parallel, but the two agents strictly alternate (each waits for the other's message), and the moves
# among equal costs come from the seed of the oracle, so the C# fixes every line (exact trace). "line" checks the whole
# trace, the other facts each kind.
cover all
fact line ^(.*)$
fact message ^\t\[(\w+) -> (\w+)\]: (.*)$
fact move ^(agent1) moves to state (\w+)$
fact update ^(agent1) updates h\((\w+)\) = (\d+)$
fact goal ^(agent1) reached goal state (\w+)$
same line seq
same message seq
same move seq
same update seq
same goal seq
check goal count == 1
